### **HTML'da Ishlatish**

`blog/templates/blog/bosh.html`:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Mening Blogim</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Salom {{ ism }}! 👋</h1>
